OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident declared at two 
OL,4,Ahospitals                              
OL,6,FTwo hospitals have declared a "critical
OL,7,Fincident" due to sustained pressures,  
OL,8,Fwith priority being given to the most  
OL,9,Fserious cases.                         
OL,11,FUniversity Hospitals of                
OL,12,FNorthamptonshire said both Kettering   
OL,13,Fand Northampton General were impacted, 
OL,14,Fand the pressure meant some patients   
OL,15,Fwere "waiting longer than we would want
OL,16,Ffor non-urgent treatment or a bed".    
OL,18,FMedical director Hemant Nemade said its
OL,19,Fteams were working to help patients who
OL,20,Fwere well enough to leave hospital to  
OL,21,Fget home or move into community care - 
OL,22,Fas safely and quickly as possible.     
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
